~ initialize_local_variables

=> start

~ start
Shopkeeper: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_shh")]Shh. Be quiet. My daughter's just fallen asleep. 
Shopkeeper: She's been helping me out all day and I'd hate for us to wake her up with our chatter. 
Shopkeeper: Oh my. You look terrible. How long has it been since you last slept?
Shopkeeper: Anyway, you're finally here, and that's all that matters! I've been expecting you. 
Shopkeeper: I know who you are and why you've come. The Goddess told me everything. 
Shopkeeper: Except for your name. What shall I call you?
- I'm not sure...
	Sarah: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_open")]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad 
- Keeper, something...
	Sarah: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_open")]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad 
- I can't remember...
	Sarah: [do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_open")]...Dad? What's going on? Who is that? => dad 
	
~ dad
Shopkeeper: Hells. Go back to sleep, pumpkin. Everything's fine. 
Sarah: [#sprite=upset][do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_sniff")]I've had one of those dreams again... They're back. They want to kill me.
Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]Shush. Back to bed. I'm right behind you. 
Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried][wait=0.6]...I'm sorry. Have to go. That there's your room. I've readied a change of clothes and a warm bath for you. 
Shopkeeper: Make sure to get some sleep. Tomorrow we wake early. 
Shopkeeper: See you then. 
- Sorry I woke her up.
	Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]No harm done. It wasn't you. 
	Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END 
- Weird welcoming party. 
	Shopkeeper: [#sprite=worried]Hah. I know. You'll have to forgive me. Hospitality is usually my strong suit.
	Shopkeeper: I'll make it up to you, I promise. Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END 
- But I have so many questions. 
	Shopkeeper: And I'll answer each and every one of them as best I can. 
	Shopkeeper: But it will have to wait until tomorrow. Forgive me. 
	Shopkeeper: Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END  
- Who wants to kill her?
	Shopkeeper: No one. It's just these nightmares she's been having.
	Shopkeeper: Nothing to worry about. Good night.[do DialogueFuncs.play_sfx("sfx_door_close")] => END 


=> END

